IMPORT prelude

-- Customs Undertakings (Penalties) Act 1981 (Cth). Source:
-- ../registers/source-bundle/C2004A02425.txt. Seat: the person who gave the
-- undertaking.

§ `Nouns`

DECLARE `Undertaking case` HAS
    `breached`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `prescribed percentage`                             IS A NUMBER
    `value per unit`                                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `units`                                             IS A NUMBER
    `value of the goods`                                IS A NUMBER
    -- s 4(2): what was required (a quantity or a value) and what was entered
    `required for full compliance`                      IS A NUMBER
    `entered in partial compliance`                     IS A NUMBER

§ `Rules`

@ref s 3(2)
GIVEN c IS A `Undertaking case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the value of the goods for` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c's `value per unit`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN c's `value of the goods`
    WHEN JUST v  THEN v TIMES c's `units`

@ref s 4
@export default The penalty I owe under s 4 of the Customs Undertakings (Penalties) Act 1981 (Cth) for breaching my Customs undertaking: the prescribed percentage set out in it of the value of the goods (at its unit value, if it sets one), reduced in proportion to what I entered for home consumption in partial compliance (by quantity or by value, as the undertaking required). Nil if no breach. DRAFT, not reviewed by an Australian lawyer.
GIVEN c IS A `Undertaking case`  @desc The breach, the prescribed percentage, the goods' value, and any partial compliance
GIVETH A NUMBER
`my undertaking penalty for` c MEANS
    IF NOT (c's `breached`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE full MINUS reduction
    WHERE
        full MEANS c's `prescribed percentage` DIVIDED BY 100 TIMES `the value of the goods for` c
        share MEANS
            IF c's `required for full compliance` GREATER THAN 0
            THEN (IF c's `entered in partial compliance` AT MOST c's `required for full compliance`
                  THEN c's `entered in partial compliance` DIVIDED BY c's `required for full compliance`
                  ELSE 1)
            ELSE 0
        reduction MEANS full TIMES share
